  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        526.96337890625,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "Based on the data presented at the GDG meeting, it was concluded that the safety profile of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.9039916992188,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "novel TBSTs is similar to that of the TST, and is associated with mostly mild ISR such as itching",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        527.145751953125,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "and pain. From the reviewed studies, there appears to be no safety signal that might affect the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.990395545959473,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        526.964599609375,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "choice between specific TBSTs and the TST. However, the group also noted that this was not a",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        131.16119384765625,
        527.0206909179688,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "full safety review covering product safety, animal or preclinical studies. Regulatory assessment",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.996099472045898,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.66119384765625,
        415.29345703125,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "for safety is needed before any of the TBST products are implemented.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        172.1728057861328,
        304.7347106933594,
        188.5528106689453
      ],
      "text": "Cost and cost–effectiveness analysis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        197.3037109375,
        526.93701171875,
        210.44871520996094
      ],
      "text": "Two reviews following Preferred Reporting Items for Systematic Reviews and Meta-Analyses",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        211.3037109375,
        457.3883972167969,
        224.44871520996094
      ],
      "text": "(PRISMA) guidelines were carried out to look at costs and cost–effectiveness of:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        231.05572509765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        244.2007293701172
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        231.05572509765625,
        426.4023132324219,
        244.2007293701172
      ],
      "text": "novel TBST, such as Diaskintest, C-TST and Cy-Tb (primary review); and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        246.55572509765625,
        78.81909942626953,
        259.70074462890625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        246.55572509765625,
        273.53338623046875,
        259.70074462890625
      ],
      "text": "TST and IGRA tests (secondary review).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.394287109375,
        526.7061157226562,
        286.539306640625
      ],
      "text": "The articles searched were those presenting economic evaluations of the diagnostic tests",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        288.894287109375,
        526.966552734375,
        302.039306640625
      ],
      "text": "(costs and cost–effectiveness) using a health provider perspective and related to TB infection",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        304.394287109375,
        527.0084228515625,
        317.539306640625
      ],
      "text": "in humans. The articles reviewed were those written in English, Chinese or Russian languages,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        319.8941955566406,
        526.925048828125,
        333.0392150878906
      ],
      "text": "and published in Medline, OVID, Chinese Biomedical Literature, China National Knowledge",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.3941955566406,
        527.223388671875,
        348.5392150878906
      ],
      "text": "Infrastructure and Russian e-library databases. Quality of studies was assessed using",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        350.8941955566406,
        182.47149658203125,
        364.0392150878906
      ],
      "text": "Drummond’s checklist.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        373.3982238769531,
        527.0009155273438,
        386.5432434082031
      ],
      "text": "In addition, a Markov-chain model was developed for the purposes of the GDG meeting, to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.3982238769531,
        526.9634399414062,
        400.5432434082031
      ],
      "text": "study the cost–effectiveness of TBSTs versus the currently available tests, the TST and IGRAs.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.3982238769531,
        526.9645385742188,
        414.5432434082031
      ],
      "text": "When simulating a cohort of individuals transitioning among different states and steps along",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        415.3982238769531,
        482.0171813964844,
        428.5432434082031
      ],
      "text": "the TB cascade of care, the model took into consideration the following parameters:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        435.15020751953125,
        78.81909942626953,
        448.29522705078125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        435.15020751953125,
        404.24273681640625,
        448.29522705078125
      ],
      "text": "prevalence of TB infection in TB-negative individuals, percentage;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        450.65020751953125,
        78.81909942626953,
        463.79522705078125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        450.65020751953125,
        527.1732177734375,
        463.79522705078125
      ],
      "text": "people completing treatment after initiation following a positive TB infection result,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        466.15020751953125,
        144.09840393066406,
        479.29522705078125
      ],
      "text": "percentage;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        481.65020751953125,
        78.81909942626953,
        494.79522705078125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        481.65020751953125,
        482.7717590332031,
        494.79522705078125
      ],
      "text": "people not initiating treatment after testing positive for TB infection, percentage;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        497.15020751953125,
        78.81909942626953,
        510.29522705078125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        497.15020751953125,
        526.96435546875,
        510.29522705078125
      ],
      "text": "people interrupting treatment after initiation following a positive TB infection test result,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        512.6502075195312,
        144.09840393066406,
        525.7952270507812
      ],
      "text": "percentage;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        528.1502075195312,
        78.81909942626953,
        541.2952270507812
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        528.1502075195312,
        350.52978515625,
        541.2952270507812
      ],
      "text": "progression from TB infection to active TB, probability;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        543.6502075195312,
        78.81909942626953,
        556.7952270507812
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        543.6502075195312,
        250.59800720214844,
        556.7952270507812
      ],
      "text": "efficacy of TB infection treatment;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        559.1502075195312,
        78.81909942626953,
        572.2952270507812
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        559.1502075195312,
        231.01820373535156,
        572.2952270507812
      ],
      "text": "active TB treatment coverage;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        574.650146484375,
        78.81909942626953,
        587.795166015625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        574.650146484375,
        308.20733642578125,
        587.795166015625
      ],
      "text": "recovery from active TB (treated + untreated);",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        590.150146484375,
        78.81909942626953,
        603.295166015625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        590.150146484375,
        295.4913330078125,
        603.295166015625
      ],
      "text": "death from active TB (treated + untreated);",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.650146484375,
        78.81909942626953,
        618.795166015625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        605.650146484375,
        501.98870849609375,
        618.795166015625
      ],
      "text": "probability of a true positive test result if the patient has TB infection (sensitivity); and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        621.150146484375,
        78.81909942626953,
        634.295166015625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        621.150146484375,
        524.54931640625,
        634.295166015625
      ],
      "text": "probability of a true negative test result if the patient does not have TB infection (specificity).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.967351913452148,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        647.9888305664062,
        526.93701171875,
        661.1338500976562
      ],
      "text": "Model parameters, unit costs and estimates of diagnostic test accuracy were sourced from",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        663.4888305664062,
        526.9369506835938,
        676.6338500976562
      ],
      "text": "the literature, including from the systematic reviews mentioned above. The manufacturers of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        678.9888305664062,
        526.9799194335938,
        692.1338500976562
      ],
      "text": "novel TBSTs were also contacted to source costs of the new tests. However, only Generium,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        694.4888305664062,
        526.8599243164062,
        707.6338500976562
      ],
      "text": "the manufacturer of Diaskintest, provided estimated test costs, including delivery costs, for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        709.9888305664062,
        526.9678344726562,
        723.1338500976562
      ],
      "text": "different delivery volumes. Consequently, the modelling study focused on Diaskintest as the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        725.4888305664062,
        265.0898132324219,
        738.6338500976562
      ],
      "text": "representative of the TBST class of tests.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        749.49267578125,
        526.6475219726562,
        762.6376953125
      ],
      "text": "The model was parameterized to three countries: Brazil, South Africa and the United Kingdom.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.978779792785645,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        764.99267578125,
        526.5633544921875,
        778.1376953125
      ],
      "text": "Three testing strategies were considered in this analysis: Diaskintest (index); the TST; and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        38.466400146484375,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "134 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
